  "body": "**Stacked on #566.** This branch is #566's branch plus one commit. Until #566 merges, the diff here includes #566; the change of its own is the last commit. Merge #566 first.\n\n## What changed\n\nA viewport pick fires on mouse release. A layout change that hides the Properties pane applies before the dock. So a release could land in a still-live locate draft in the same frame its form went off screen, before #566's after-dock sweep dropped it.\n\n- **`crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs`:** the pre-dock check that disarms the Setups page picks when Properties isn't shown (#667's `disarm_all`) now also calls `locate_pick::disarm`. That's 3 lines.\n\n## Pinned by\n\n`egui_app::tests::setup_picks_disarm::a_click_in_the_frame_the_pane_hides_misses_the_hidden_locate_draft`. It's #667's same-frame test shape on a locate draft armed from Setup1's Fixtures page.\n- **Without the drop it fails:** the release reaches the hidden draft and its status asks for the vise again.\n- **With the drop it passes.**\n\n## How tested\n\n- `camcraft-ui --lib`: 430 pass, 5 ignored.\n- `setup_picks_disarm`: 7/7.\n- clippy on `camcraft-ui --tests` is clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo GUI hand run. The fork is synced at v0.16.0; the branch is #566's, refreshed on upstream main.\n\nChangelog: A locate-in-fixture pick can no longer land in a draft whose form was hidden in the same frame (#673)\n\nFixes #673\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
